.SS "void csmp::LinearTriangle3D::N (std::vector< double > & N, const std::vector< double > & xyz)\fR [virtual]\fP"

.PP
element interpolation functions at the point xzy Computes the basis functions for this linear triangle element in 3D space at the point 'xyz' within the plane of the triangle\&. 
.br
.SH "Input Arguments"
.PP
The method uses the data of the '\fBElement\fP' to retrieve nodal coordinates, and the point location supplied as third method argument\&. 
